    "memoText": " \n                         VETO MESSAGE - No. 163\n \nTO THE SENATE:\n \nI am returning herewith, without my approval, the following bill:\n \nSenate Bill Number 8377-A, entitled:\n \n    \"AN  ACT  in  relation to directing the commissioner of education to\n      conduct a survey of recess held in  schools  serving  students  in\n      kindergarten through grade six\"\n \n    NOT APPROVED\n \n  This bill directs the commissioner of education to survey recess prac-\ntices at public and charter schools serving grades K-6.\n \n  As with numerous other bills I have vetoed that require state agencies\nto  undertake  studies, this legislation would create new administrative\nburdens and impose unbudgeted  costs.  The  state  education  department\nwould  be  tasked with developing this survey and local school districts\nwould need to dedicate personnel time and effort to complete it.\n \n  Therefore, I am constrained to veto this bill.\n \n  The bill is disapproved.                       (signed) KATHY HOCHUL\n \n                               __________\n",
